    "displayName": "PL_FMD_LOAD_GOLD",
    "description": "Gold-layer load pipeline of a business domain: NB_LOAD_GOLD, then NB_MLV_EXAMPLE. Owned by the customer: the setup creates it once in every stage and never overwrites it, so add your domain's own notebooks and a PBISemanticModelRefresh activity here, in Dev, and promote it. Invoked from PL_FMD_ORCHESTRATION after PL_FMD_LOAD_ALL succeeded (wired in by NB_SETUP_BUSINESS_DOMAINS)."
  },
